    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377466
    m_Localized: "CONSTRUCCI\xD3N"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377467
    m_Localized: "Eleg\xED un plano o arrastralo al mapa."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377468
    m_Localized: "TRIPULACI\xD3N  /  ASIGNACIONES"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377469
    m_Localized: "1 \xB7 ELEG\xCD UN ASTRONAUTA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377470
    m_Localized: "2 \xB7 ELEG\xCD UNA INSTALACI\xD3N"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377471
    m_Localized: "El bono se aplica por sol mientras trabaja; al cansarse descansa autom\xE1ticamente."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377472
    m_Localized: DEJAR TAREA / DESCANSAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377473
    m_Localized: ANTERIORES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377474
    m_Localized: SIGUIENTES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377475
    m_Localized: ADMINISTRAR ASTRONAUTAS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377476
    m_Localized: "CERRAR  \xD7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377477
    m_Localized: ELEGIR CULTIVO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377478
    m_Localized: "ELEG\xCD QU\xC9 CULTIVAR"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377479
    m_Localized: "Los ciclos avanzan con cada sol. Si falta agua o energ\xEDa, el cultivo espera."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377480
    m_Localized: OBJETO SELECCIONADO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377481
    m_Localized: REPARAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377482
    m_Localized: ELIMINAR ESTRUCTURA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377483
    m_Localized: "Reembolso: aproximadamente 50 % del costo base. Los dep\xF3sitos minerales permanecen en el terreno."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377484
    m_Localized: "ALERTA \xB7 INSTALACI\xD3N AVERIADA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377485
    m_Localized: "NIVEL {0} \xB7 M\xC1XIMO\nXP {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377486
    m_Localized: "NIVEL {0}/5 \xB7 XP {1}/{2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377487
    m_Localized: 'AVANZAR SOL

      AUTO {0:00}:{1:00}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377488
    m_Localized: SOL <b>{0:00}</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377489
    m_Localized: "ROVER {0} \xB7 LISTO\nRadio {1} \xB7 visi\xF3n {2}\nAlmac\xE9n {3}/{4}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377490
    m_Localized: "ROVER {0} \xB7 EN RUTA\nSector {1}\nAlmac\xE9n {2}/{3}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377491
    m_Localized: "ROVER {0} \xB7 LOG\xCDSTICA\nCarga {1}/{2} \xB7 Fe {3} O2 {4}\nAg {5} Co {6}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215377492
    m_Localized: "MURO \xB7 1 Fe\nMuros {0} \xB7 Hierro {1} \xB7 Uni\xF3n autom\xE1tica"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002387353600
    m_Localized: "Preparando la carta orbital\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002395742208
    m_Localized: "Repar\xE1 {0} ({1} Fe y {2} energ\xEDa)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002395742209
    m_Localized: "El almac\xE9n est\xE1 lleno. Constru\xED otro y envi\xE1 el rover a descargar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130816
    m_Localized: "Explor\xE1 la regi\xF3n para localizar hierro y hielo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130817
    m_Localized: "La carta orbital indica hierro al {0}, a {1} sectores. Envi\xE1 el rover y estudialo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130818
    m_Localized: "Seleccion\xE1 el yacimiento estudiado y constru\xED la mina ({0} de hierro)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130819
    m_Localized: "Hay hielo al {0}, a {1} sectores. Envi\xE1 el rover a localizarlo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130820
    m_Localized: "Constru\xED un extractor para asegurar agua ({0} de hierro)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130821
    m_Localized: "Constru\xED un invernadero para iniciar la cosecha (6 de hierro)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130822
    m_Localized: "Explor\xE1 y constru\xED para ganar XP y alcanzar el nivel 3 ({0}/{1})."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130823
    m_Localized: "Manten\xE9 la colonia hasta el sol 7 (ahora {0})."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1002404130824
    m_Localized: "Revis\xE1 recursos y explor\xE1 yacimientos lejanos para crecer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
